</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Multiple cancer types</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Anti-cancer immunity</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<em>TYK2</em>
</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Translational hypothesis: activation of TYK2 will increase anti-tumor immunogenicity</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Bone marrow</td>
