<em>EIF6</em>
</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Translational hypothesis: reduction in EIF6 dose or activity will l ead to disease-modifying benefits in SDS</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Liver</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Alpha-1 antitrypsin deficiency (AATD)</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<em>SERPINA1</em>
</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Translational hypothesis: therapeutic targeting of C terminus of alpha-1-antitrypsin will lead to chain truncation and disease-modifying benefits in A1AD</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Liver</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Metabolic-dysfunction-associated steatohepatitis (MASH)</td>
