</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Translational hypothesis: inhibition of <em>CIDEB</em> or <em>GPAM</em> or targeting <em>FOXO1</em> at site S22 will benefit MASH patients; CIDEB-siRNA is being tested clinically (<a href="https://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/NCT06836609" class="usa-link" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NCT06836609</a>)</td>
